+# OmniRoute — Final Free Autopilot: R4 Quota / Circuit Breaker / Workload Isolation (redo from primary source)
+
+Mission: OMNIROUTE_FREE_AUTOPILOT_FINAL_RECONSTRUCTION_R1_11_R4_LIVE_CLOSURE_2026_09_21
